From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Corry K <blueblau@163.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] mimo_v2: MiMo-V2.6-Flash model for the native backend

New model package vllm_neuron/model/mimo_v2 and NKI kernels in
vllm_neuron/_kernels/mimo_v2:

- text backbone: hybrid sliding-window / global attention with attention
  sinks, 256-expert MoE with top-8 routing, FP8 block linear layers, FP8
  experts expanded losslessly from the checkpoint's MXFP4
- weight loader for the original Hugging Face checkpoint (no conversion)
- NKI attention kernels: decode (one position-major kernel for every
  configuration) and prefill / segmented prefill
- static expert-parallel placement with replicas
- MTP (1-3 layers) and DFlash draft models
- vision encoder and the two audio towers on Trainium
- prompt logprobs on device
